<title>USA: Gundle/SLT Q4 net income rises.</title>
<headline>Gundle/SLT Q4 net income rises.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>GUNDLE/SLT ENVIRONMENTAL INC</p>
<p>			    3 Mos ended 12/31    12 Mos ended 12/31</p>
<p>					1996     1995     1996     1995</p>
<p> SALES			   $ 49,742$ 58,256 $209,372 $248,063</p>
<p> GROSS PROFIT		    10,446  10,262   49,871   47,690</p>
<p> NET INCOME (LOSS)		2,008   1,561   11,646  (2,231)</p>
<p> EPS				   0.12    0.09     0.67   (0.13)</p>
<p> EPS BEFORE CHARGES		0.12    0.09     0.67     0.46</p>
<p> WGTD AVG SHRS		   17,360  17,195   17,314   17,193</p>
<p>			(in thousands except per share data)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1995 net income includes nonrecurring charges of $10.1 million, or $0.59.</p>
<p>The company's backlog at December 31, 1996, was $57.2 million, up 11 percent from year-end 1995.</p>
</text>
